        "text": "Page: Tess Asplund. Sentence: David Lagerlof is the photographer of the viral image of Asplund, which shows her facing uniformed members of the Swedish Nordic Resistance Movement with her fist in the air.\nPage: Nordic Resistance Movement. Sentence: The Nordic Resistance Movement (Swedish: \"Nordiska Motståndsrörelsen; NMR\" , Norwegian: \"Nordiske motstandsbevegelsen; NMB\" , Finnish: \"Pohjoismainen vastarintaliike; PVL\" , Danish: \"Nordiske modstandsbevægelse; NMB\" ) is a Nordic Neo-Nazi movement that exists in Sweden, Finland, and Norway.",
